      "start_seconds": 1.22,
      "end_seconds": 9.97,
      "duration_seconds": 8.75,
      "text": "Doctor, the patient's with us now. I did the usual checks at the front, so just say when you want them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.9,
      "end_seconds": 16.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "great hello, come in and sit down how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.38,
      "end_seconds": 30.29,
      "duration_seconds": 11.91,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, I've been feeling cold all the time, and I wanted to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.02,
      "end_seconds": 38.48,
      "duration_seconds": 6.46,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.21,
      "end_seconds": 49.42,
      "duration_seconds": 9.21,
      "text": "Uh, uh, it's been two years now. I've also been putting on weight. Oh, and tiredness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.35,
      "end_seconds": 54.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "And what about palpitations, low mood or trouble swallowing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.0,
      "end_seconds": 58.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "ah, no, none that I've noticed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.15,
      "end_seconds": 61.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. Nothing like hair loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.3,
      "end_seconds": 65.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Not at all, no hair loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.88,
      "end_seconds": 67.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.39,
      "end_seconds": 71.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "No weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.23,
      "end_seconds": 83.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.93,
      "end_seconds": 97.47,
      "duration_seconds": 12.54,
      "text": "Low haemoglobin, for nearly five years. Diabetes, for about a year. Sorry, you know, what was I saying, I've had heart disease, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.03,
      "end_seconds": 106.03,
      "duration_seconds": 7.0,
      "text": "Yes, carry on. Okay, I can see low haemoglobin in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.78,
      "end_seconds": 122.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.3,
      "end_seconds": 128.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.97,
      "end_seconds": 131.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.72,
      "end_seconds": 135.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.47,
      "end_seconds": 139.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.09,
      "end_seconds": 145.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.69,
      "end_seconds": 149.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.33,
      "end_seconds": 171.3,
      "duration_seconds": 20.97,
      "text": "Iron tablets, once a day for my blood count. Well, uh, I do miss it it now and then, to be fair. I take sitagliptin, 100 milligrams, once a day. It's aspirin, 75 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.19,
      "end_seconds": 176.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.3,
      "end_seconds": 181.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "I mean, my uncle has high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.44,
      "end_seconds": 189.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.38,
      "end_seconds": 195.65,
      "duration_seconds": 5.27,
      "text": "Just two stents put in my heart, three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 196.25,
      "end_seconds": 205.53,
      "duration_seconds": 9.28,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Respiratory rate 18, temperature 36.9, BP is 122 over 77, saturation 98 percent, heart rate 82."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.39,
      "end_seconds": 207.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.34,
      "end_seconds": 214.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.9,
      "end_seconds": 216.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.18,
      "end_seconds": 232.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Reflexes are a bit slow to relax."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.29,
      "end_seconds": 234.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.43,
      "end_seconds": 253.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Your pulse is slow, about fifty-six, and the thyroid isn't enlarged."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.38,
      "end_seconds": 257.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "thank you, you can get dressed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.75,
      "end_seconds": 294.27,
      "duration_seconds": 28.52,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: It fits best with an underactive thyroid. Let's get blood tests, for fatigue. I think a thyroid test makes sense here, for hypothyroid symptoms. For this, levothyroxine, 50 micrograms, every morning on an empty stomach, until we review. You take it by mouth. That's for hypothyroidism. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.91,
      "end_seconds": 311.3,
      "duration_seconds": 16.39,
      "text": "Take the thyroid tablet on an empty stomach, half an hour before breakfast, and not with calcium or iron. Let's review you after the results are back. What are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.03,
      "end_seconds": 324.58,
      "duration_seconds": 12.55,
      "text": "So, I take the levothyroxine, 50 micrograms, every morning on an empty stomach and come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.75,
      "end_seconds": 331.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 332.17,
      "end_seconds": 336.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Well, good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
